            "block_content": "MEMORANDUM OF AGREEMENT\nBetween\nVERIZON NORTH INC. (NORTH CENTRAL REGION)\nAnd\nINTERNATIONAL BROTHERHOOD OF ELECTRICAL WORKERS, LOCAL 986\nFLEXIBLE REIMBURSEMENT PLAN (FRP)",
